{"repositoryId":920344745,"availability":"available","full":"MLNeurosurg/Prima","name":"Prima","description":"Explore this public GitHub project.","category":"Other","language":"Python","stars":85,"forks":15,"created":"2025-01-22T01:36:15Z","updated":"2026-07-15T19:37:51Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://prima.mlins.org/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T13:26:15.617Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T13:26:15.617Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T13:26:15.617Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-16T13:26:15.617Z","stars":85,"forks":15}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This is the official code repository for paper submission \"Learning neuroimaging models from health system-scale data\", where we introduced Prima, the first general-purpose MRI VLM trained on health system-scale data. Demo Website","The global demand for magnetic resonance imaging (MRI) studies has risen steadily, placing significant strain on health systems, prolonging turnaround times, and intensifying physician burnout. These challenges disproportionately impact patients in low-resource and rural settings. Here, we utilized a large academic health system as a data engine to develop Prima, the first vision language model (VLM) serving as an AI foundation for neuroimaging that supports real-world, clinical MRI studies as input. We curated a health system-scale dataset, UM-220K, which consists of over 220,000 MRI studies…"],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MLNeurosurg/Prima/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"a7ae096cc25fb44bc73daf673746e4c1a43da14c341a1776a59ee320975768f9","extractedAt":"2026-10-16T13:26:16.022Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T13:26:16.022Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"This is the official code repository for paper submission \"Learning neuroimaging models from health system-scale data\", where we introduced Prima, the first general-purpo